      "raw": {
        "comments": [
          {
            "date": "2023-12-09 06:00:19 UTC",
            "uid": 12926597,
            "user": "ericforman87",
            "user_url": "https://api.openstreetmap.org/user/ericforman87",
            "action": "opened",
            "text": "There is a drawbridge here (Tammany Trace Bicycle & Foot Path) that is raised & lowered everyday at dusk/dawn. Not sure if it's possible to make that official as far as directions/navigation goes but just thought I'd make a note of it. The West side of the waterway is also where the Lacombe Trailhead for the Trace is. ",
            "html": "<p dir=\"auto\">There is a drawbridge here (Tammany Trace Bicycle &amp; Foot Path) that is raised &amp; lowered everyday at dusk/dawn. Not sure if it's possible to make that official as far as directions/navigation goes but just thought I'd make a note of it. The West side of the waterway is also where the Lacombe Trailhead for the Trace is. </p>"
          },
          {
            "date": "2023-12-10 15:44:29 UTC",
            "uid": 3444743,
            "user": "bdentremont",
            "user_url": "https://api.openstreetmap.org/user/bdentremont",
            "action": "commented",
            "text": "I think this might look like\naccess = yes\naccess:conditional = no @ 00:00-dawn, dusk-24:00\n\nThoughts?  I will probably revisit this later.\n\nhttps://help.openstreetmap.org/questions/35189/appropriate-to-use-opening_hours-on-a-road-gate-or-trail\n\nhttps://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:opening_hours/specification",
            "html": "<p dir=\"auto\">I think this might look like\n<br />access = yes\n<br />access:conditional = no @ 00:00-dawn, dusk-24:00</p>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Thoughts?  I will probably revisit this later.</p>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://help.openstreetmap.org/questions/35189/appropriate-to-use-opening_hours-on-a-road-gate-or-trail\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" dir=\"auto\">https://help.openstreetmap.org/questions/35189/appropriate-to-use-opening_hours-on-a-road-gate-or-trail</a></p>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:opening_hours/specification\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" dir=\"auto\">opening_hours=*/specification</a></p>"
          },
          {
            "date": "2023-12-10 16:04:23 UTC",
            "uid": 12926597,
            "user": "ericforman87",
            "user_url": "https://api.openstreetmap.org/user/ericforman87",
            "action": "commented",
            "text": "Yeah, I think that might work, actually ",
            "html": "<p dir=\"auto\">Yeah, I think that might work, actually </p>"
          },
          {
            "date": "2023-12-10 16:05:04 UTC",
            "uid": 12926597,
            "user": "ericforman87",
            "user_url": "https://api.openstreetmap.org/user/ericforman87",
            "action": "commented",
            "text": "I'm still very new to all this, but map editing is apparently a huge interest for me. It's also quite overwhelming. Lol",
            "html": "<p dir=\"auto\">I'm still very new to all this, but map editing is apparently a huge interest for me. It's also quite overwhelming. Lol</p>"
          },
          {
            "date": "2023-12-10 20:56:08 UTC",
            "uid": 3444743,
            "user": "bdentremont",
            "user_url": "https://api.openstreetmap.org/user/bdentremont",
            "action": "commented",
            "text": "I've added the restriction to be bridge, as well as bridge:movable=drawbridge.\n\nhttps://www.openstreetmap.org/way/35602632\n\nShould the same be applied to the trail?  Most rail trails that I've seen would be permissive of night use, but if this one is extensively signposted that that is illegal, it should probably me mark.  The trail website indicates that the hours for the bridge and trail are the same at 7AM-5PM, which I presume would be about dawn to dusk this time of year.\n\nhttp://www.tammanytrace.org/index.php/closures",
            "html": "<p dir=\"auto\">I've added the restriction to be bridge, as well as <a href=\"https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Tag:bridge:movable=drawbridge\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" dir=\"auto\">bridge:movable=drawbridge</a>.</p>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/35602632\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" dir=\"auto\">way/35602632</a></p>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Should the same be applied to the trail?  Most rail trails that I've seen would be permissive of night use, but if this one is extensively signposted that that is illegal, it should probably me mark.  The trail website indicates that the hours for the bridge and trail are the same at 7AM-5PM, which I presume would be about dawn to dusk this time of year.</p>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"http://www.tammanytrace.org/index.php/closures\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" dir=\"auto\">http://www.tammanytrace.org/index.php/closures</a></p>"
          },
          {
            "date": "2023-12-10 21:22:27 UTC",
            "uid": 12926597,
            "user": "ericforman87",
            "user_url": "https://api.openstreetmap.org/user/ericforman87",
            "action": "commented",
            "text": "Yeah actually I don't know why I didn't think to just include that along with the bridge. I sometimes ride on the trace with a bunch of lights on cuz it's not lit up at night, but yeah generally it's supposed to be closed overnight.",
            "html": "<p dir=\"auto\">Yeah actually I don't know why I didn't think to just include that along with the bridge. I sometimes ride on the trace with a bunch of lights on cuz it's not lit up at night, but yeah generally it's supposed to be closed overnight.</p>"
          },
          {
            "date": "2025-01-09 00:43:46 UTC",
            "uid": 22289325,
            "user": "OSMoperator",
            "user_url": "https://api.openstreetmap.org/user/OSMoperator",
            "action": "commented",
            "text": "Hey mappers, the bridge was not showing up properly in the openstreetmap.org iD editor. I changed man_made=bridge to bridge=yes and now it shows properly. I left the moveable type tag.",
            "html": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hey mappers, the bridge was not showing up properly in the openstreetmap.org iD editor. I changed <a href=\"https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Tag:man_made=bridge\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" dir=\"auto\">man_made=bridge</a> to <a href=\"https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Tag:bridge=yes\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" dir=\"auto\">bridge=yes</a> and now it shows properly. I left the moveable type tag.</p>"
          }
        ]
      },
      "publication_region": "new-orleans"
